      "date": "2026-04-11T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Capricorn Systems Global Solutions Limited (BSE:512169) agreed to acquire Radical Bio-Organics Limited.",
      "body": "Capricorn Systems Global Solutions Limited (BSE:512169) agreed to acquire Radical Bio-Organics Limited on April 11, 2026. The share exchange ratio for the amalgamation of the Capricorn Systems Global with the Radical Bio-Organics Limited shall be 1 fully paid-up equity share of Capricorn Systems Global for every 1 fully paid-up equity share of Radical Bio-Organics Limited.\n\nFor the period ending February 28, 2026, Radical Bio-Organics Limited reported total revenue of INR 4.52 billion. As of February 28, 2026, Radical Bio-Organics Limited reported total assets of INR 2.26 billion and total common equity of INR 717.99 million.\n\nThe transaction is subject to approval of offer by Capricorn Systems Global Solutions board. The deal has been approved by the board.",
